{"path":"force-app/main/default/lwc/rlySyncStatus/rlySyncStatus.html","left":null,"right":"<template>\n    <!-- design board: Sync status (2026-11-07) — fits the screen, each section scrolls on its own -->\n    <template lwc:if={statusRead}>\n        <c-rly-org-gate status={hubStatus}></c-rly-org-gate>\n        <template lwc:if={showPage}>\n            <div class=\"rr-page\">\n                <template lwc:if={showSpinner}><lightning-spinner alternative-text=\"Loading\" size=\"small\"></lightning-spinner></template>\n\n                <section class=\"rr-card rr-head\">\n                    <span class=\"rr-head-icon\"><lightning-icon icon-name=\"utility:sync\" size=\"x-small\" variant=\"inverse\" alternative-text=\"\"></lightning-icon></span>\n                    <div class=\"rr-head-text\">\n                        <p class=\"rr-kicker\">{appName}</p>\n                        <h1 class=\"rr-title\">Sync status</h1>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"rr-segs\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"View\">\n                        <template for:each={viewButtons} for:item=\"v\">\n                            <button key={v.value} type=\"button\" class={v.cls} data-value={v.value} aria-pressed={v.pressed} onclick={handleView}>{v.label}</button>\n                        </template>\n                    </div>\n                    <lightning-button-icon icon-name=\"utility:refresh\" variant=\"border-filled\" alternative-text=\"Read again\" title=\"Read again\" onclick={refresh}></lightning-button-icon>\n                    <span class=\"rr-ticks\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                        <template for:each={ticks} for:item=\"t\">\n                            <span key={t.key} class={t.cls} data-id={t.id} onanimationend={handleTick}></span>\n                        </template>\n                    </span>\n                </section>\n\n                <template lwc:if={error}><div class=\"rr-msg rr-msg-bad\" role=\"alert\">{error}</div></template>\n\n                <!-- org vs branch -->\n                <template lwc:if={isOrgView}>\n                    <div class=\"rr-orgs\">\n                        <template for:each={orgCards} for:item=\"o\">\n                            <div key={o.orgId} class={o.cls}>\n                                <button type=\"button\" class=\"rr-org-pick\" data-id={o.orgId} aria-pressed={o.current} onclick={pickOrg}>\n                                    <span class=\"rr-org-top\"><strong>{o.name}</strong><span class={o.tagCls}>{o.tagLabel}</span></span>\n                                    <span class={o.bigCls}>{o.big}</span>\n                                    <span class=\"rr-small rr-weak\"><span class=\"rr-mono\">{o.branch}</span> · {o.checked}</span>\n                                    <template lwc:if={o.detail}><span class=\"rr-small rr-weak\">{o.detail}</span></template>\n                                    <template lwc:if={o.message}><span class=\"rr-small rr-bad-text\">{o.message}</span></template>\n                                </button>\n                                <div class=\"rr-org-actions\">\n                                    <lightning-button label=\"Check now\" data-id={o.orgId} onclick={checkOrg} disabled={o.cantCheck}></lightning-button>\n                                    <template lwc:if={o.runUrl}><a class=\"rr-a rr-small\" href={o.runUrl} target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Open the run</a></template>\n                                    <span class=\"rr-small rr-weak\">{o.how}</span>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </template>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <section class=\"rr-card rr-split-card\">\n                        <template lwc:if={orgNever}>\n                            <div class=\"rr-empty\">Press <strong>Check now</strong> on {selectedName} to compare the org with its branch.</div>\n                        </template>\n                        <template lwc:elseif={orgWaiting}>\n                            <div class=\"rr-empty\"><lightning-spinner alternative-text=\"Checking\" size=\"small\" class=\"rr-inline-spin\"></lightning-spinner>Comparing {selectedName} with its branch… the result shows here when the run ends.</div>\n                        </template>\n                        <template lwc:elseif={orgFailed}>\n                            <div class=\"rr-msg rr-msg-bad rr-inset\">{orgFailMessage}</div>\n                        </template>\n                        <template lwc:elseif={orgResultEmpty}>\n                            <div class=\"rr-empty\"><span class=\"rr-pill rr-pill-ok\">In sync</span> {selectedName} and its branch are the same.</div>\n                        </template>\n                        <template lwc:elseif={hasOrgResult}>\n                            <div class=\"rr-split\">\n                                <nav class=\"rr-types\" aria-label=\"Types\">\n                                    <template for:each={typeRows} for:item=\"t\">\n                                        <button key={t.value} type=\"button\" class={t.cls} data-value={t.value} aria-pressed={t.pressed} onclick={pickType}>\n                                            <span class=\"rr-trunc\">{t.label}</span><span class=\"rr-weak\">{t.count}</span>\n                                        </button>\n                                    </template>\n                                </nav>\n                                <div class=\"rr-list\">\n                                    <div class=\"rr-bar\">\n                                        <c-rly-search-box class=\"rr-search\" label=\"Search the differences\" placeholder=\"Search name, type or person\"\n                                            shown={orgShownCount} total={orgTotal} onsearch={handleSearch}></c-rly-search-box>\n                                        <div class=\"rr-segs\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Difference\">\n                                            <template for:each={filterButtons} for:item=\"f\">\n                                                <button key={f.value} type=\"button\" class={f.cls} data-value={f.value} aria-pressed={f.pressed} onclick={handleFilter}>{f.label}</button>\n                                            </template>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <template lwc:if={truncatedNote}><p class=\"rr-small rr-weak rr-pad\">{truncatedNote}</p></template>\n                                    <div class=\"rr-rows\">\n                                        <div class=\"rr-row rr-row-head\"><span>Pick</span><span>Component</span><span>Difference</span><span>Last changed</span></div>\n                                        <template for:each={orgRows} for:item=\"r\">\n                                            <div key={r.key} class={r.rowCls}>\n                                                <button type=\"button\" class={r.pickCls} data-key={r.key} aria-pressed={r.pressed} onclick={togglePick}>{r.pickLabel}</button>\n                                                <button type=\"button\" class=\"rr-link rr-name\" data-key={r.key} onclick={openComponent}>\n                                                    <span class=\"rr-strong\"><template for:each={r.nameParts} for:item=\"p\"><span key={p.key} class={p.cls}>{p.text}</span></template></span>\n                                                    <span class=\"rr-small rr-weak\">{r.type}</span>\n                                                </button>\n                                                <span><span class={r.chipCls}>{r.chipLabel}</span></span>\n                                                <span class=\"rr-small rr-weak rr-trunc\">{r.changed}</span>\n                                            </div>\n                                        </template>\n                                        <template lwc:if={noOrgMatch}><p class=\"rr-empty\">No differences match.</p></template>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <template lwc:if={hasOpen}>\n                                        <div class=\"rr-open\">\n                                            <div class=\"rr-open-head\"><strong>{openTitle}</strong><span class=\"rr-grow\"></span><button type=\"button\" class=\"rr-link\" onclick={closeComponent}>Close</button></div>\n                                            <template lwc:if={hasFilePicker}>\n                                                <div class=\"rr-fpick\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Files\">\n                                                    <template for:each={openFiles} for:item=\"f\">\n                                                        <button key={f.path} type=\"button\" class={f.cls} aria-pressed={f.pressed} data-path={f.path} onclick={pickFile}>{f.label}</button>\n                                                    </template>\n                                                </div>\n                                            </template>\n                                            <template lwc:if={fileLoading}><p class=\"rr-small rr-weak rr-pad\">Reading the file…</p></template>\n                                            <template lwc:if={fileError}><div class=\"rr-msg rr-msg-bad rr-inset\">{fileError}</div></template>\n                                            <template lwc:if={openReason}><p class=\"rr-small rr-weak rr-pad\">{openReason}</p></template>\n                                            <template lwc:if={showDiff}>\n                                                <c-rly-diff-view title={diffTitle} left-label={leftLabel} right-label={rightLabel} left={leftText} right={rightText}></c-rly-diff-view>\n                                            </template>\n                                            <template lwc:if={showPatch}>\n                                                <pre class=\"rr-patch\"><template for:each={patchLines} for:item=\"l\"><span key={l.key} class={l.cls}>{l.text}</span></template></pre>\n                                            </template>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </template>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"rr-foot\">\n                                <span class=\"rr-small\"><strong>{pickText}</strong><template lwc:if={pushHint}> · <span class=\"rr-weak\">{pushHint}</span></template></span>\n                                <span class=\"rr-grow\"></span>\n                                <lightning-button label=\"Bring into the branch\" onclick={bringIntoBranch} disabled={noPicks}></lightning-button>\n                                <lightning-button variant=\"brand\" label=\"Push to the org\" onclick={pushPicked} disabled={cantPush}></lightning-button>\n                            </div>\n                        </template>\n                    </section>\n                </template>\n\n                <!-- down the route -->\n                <template lwc:if={isRouteView}>\n                    <section class=\"rr-card rr-split-card\">\n                        <div class=\"rr-bar\">\n                            <span class=\"rr-small rr-weak\">{routeChecked}</span>\n                            <template lwc:if={routeRunUrl}><a class=\"rr-a rr-small\" href={routeRunUrl} target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Open the run</a></template>\n                            <span class=\"rr-grow\"></span>\n                            <lightning-button label=\"Check the route\" onclick={checkRoute} disabled={cantCheckRoute}></lightning-button>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"rr-lane\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Pairs\">\n                            <template for:each={lanePairs} for:item=\"p\">\n                                <button key={p.key} type=\"button\" class=\"rr-pair\" data-index={p.index} aria-pressed={p.pressed} onclick={pickPair}>\n                                    <span class=\"rr-stage\"><strong>{p.higherName}</strong><span class=\"rr-mono rr-weak\">{p.higherBranch}</span></span>\n                                    <span class={p.cls}>{p.label}</span>\n                                    <span class=\"rr-stage\"><strong>{p.lowerName}</strong><span class=\"rr-mono rr-weak\">{p.lowerBranch}</span></span>\n                                </button>\n                            </template>\n                        </div>\n                        <template lwc:if={routeRunning}><div class=\"rr-empty\"><lightning-spinner alternative-text=\"Checking\" size=\"small\" class=\"rr-inline-spin\"></lightning-spinner>Comparing the branches… the result shows here when the run ends.</div></template>\n                        <template lwc:elseif={routeFailed}><div class=\"rr-msg rr-msg-bad rr-inset\">{routeMessage}</div></template>\n                        <template lwc:elseif={pairEmpty}><div class=\"rr-empty\"><span class=\"rr-pill rr-pill-ok\">In step</span> The {pairTitle} branches have nothing to bring down.</div></template>\n                        <template lwc:else>\n                            <div class=\"rr-list\">\n                                <div class=\"rr-bar\">\n                                    <span class=\"rr-small\"><strong>{pairTitle}</strong> · {pairCountText}</span>\n                                    <span class=\"rr-grow\"></span>\n                                    <c-rly-search-box class=\"rr-search\" label=\"Search\" placeholder=\"Search name, type or release\" onsearch={handleSearch}></c-rly-search-box>\n                                </div>\n                                <template lwc:if={branchOnlyNote}><p class=\"rr-small rr-weak rr-pad\">{branchOnlyNote}</p></template>\n                                <div class=\"rr-rows\">\n                                    <div class=\"rr-row rr-row-route rr-row-head\"><span>Pick</span><span>Component</span><span>Came from</span><span>Status</span></div>\n                                    <template for:each={pairRows} for:item=\"r\">\n                                        <div key={r.key} class={r.rowCls}>\n                                            <button type=\"button\" class={r.pickCls} data-key={r.key} aria-pressed={r.pressed} onclick={toggleRoutePick}>{r.pickLabel}</button>\n                                            <button type=\"button\" class=\"rr-link rr-name\" data-key={r.key} onclick={openComponent}>\n                                                <span class=\"rr-strong\"><template for:each={r.nameParts} for:item=\"p\"><span key={p.key} class={p.cls}>{p.text}</span></template></span>\n                                                <span class=\"rr-small rr-weak\">{r.type}</span>\n                                            </button>\n                                            <span class=\"rr-small rr-weak rr-trunc\">{r.cameFrom}</span>\n                                            <span><span class={r.chipCls}>{r.chipLabel}</span></span>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </template>\n                                </div>\n                                <template lwc:if={hasOpen}>\n                                    <div class=\"rr-open\">\n                                        <div class=\"rr-open-head\"><strong>{openTitle}</strong><span class=\"rr-grow\"></span><button type=\"button\" class=\"rr-link\" onclick={closeComponent}>Close</button></div>\n                                        <template lwc:if={hasFilePicker}>\n                                            <div class=\"rr-fpick\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Files\">\n                                                <template for:each={openFiles} for:item=\"f\">\n                                                    <button key={f.path} type=\"button\" class={f.cls} aria-pressed={f.pressed} data-path={f.path} onclick={pickFile}>{f.label}</button>\n                                                </template>\n                                            </div>\n                                        </template>\n                                        <template lwc:if={fileLoading}><p class=\"rr-small rr-weak rr-pad\">Reading the file…</p></template>\n                                        <template lwc:if={fileError}><div class=\"rr-msg rr-msg-bad rr-inset\">{fileError}</div></template>\n                                        <template lwc:if={openReason}><p class=\"rr-small rr-weak rr-pad\">{openReason}</p></template>\n                                        <template lwc:if={showDiff}>\n                                            <c-rly-diff-view title={diffTitle} left-label={leftLabel} right-label={rightLabel} left={leftText} right={rightText}></c-rly-diff-view>\n                                        </template>\n                                        <template lwc:if={showPatch}>\n                                            <pre class=\"rr-patch\"><template for:each={patchLines} for:item=\"l\"><span key={l.key} class={l.cls}>{l.text}</span></template></pre>\n                                        </template>\n                                    </div>\n                                </template>\n                            </div>\n                        </template>\n                        <div class=\"rr-foot\">\n                            <span class=\"rr-small\"><strong>{routePickText}</strong><template lwc:if={promoteHint}> · <span class=\"rr-weak\">{promoteHint}</span></template></span>\n                            <span class=\"rr-grow\"></span>\n                            <lightning-button label={allLabel} onclick={backPromoteAllNow} disabled={cantBackPromoteAll}></lightning-button>\n                            <lightning-button variant=\"brand\" label={pickedLabel} onclick={backPromotePickedNow} disabled={cantBackPromotePicked}></lightning-button>\n                        </div>\n                    </section>\n                </template>\n\n                <!-- data sets (build 43) -->\n                <template lwc:if={isDataView}>\n                    <c-rly-data-sync class=\"rr-data-view\"></c-rly-data-sync>\n                </template>\n\n                <!-- installed packages -->\n                <template lwc:if={isPackagesView}>\n                    <section class=\"rr-card rr-split-card\">\n                        <div class=\"rr-bar\">\n                            <span class=\"rr-small rr-weak\">{packagesChecked}</span>\n                            <span class=\"rr-grow\"></span>\n                            <lightning-button label=\"Read packages\" onclick={readPackagesNow} disabled={busy}></lightning-button>\n                        </div>\n                        <template for:each={packageErrors} for:item=\"e\"><div key={e.key} class=\"rr-msg rr-msg-bad rr-inset\">{e.text}</div></template>\n                        <template lwc:if={noPackages}><div class=\"rr-empty\">No managed packages are installed in the route's orgs.</div></template>\n                        <div class=\"rr-rows\">\n                            <div class=\"rr-pkg rr-row-head\">\n                                <span>Package</span>\n                                <span class=\"rr-pkg-versions\"><template for:each={packageHead} for:item=\"h\"><span key={h.key}>{h.name}</span></template></span>\n                                <span>Status</span><span></span>\n                            </div>\n                            <template for:each={packageRows} for:item=\"p\">\n                                <div key={p.key} class=\"rr-pkg\">\n                                    <span><span class=\"rr-strong\">{p.name}</span><span class=\"rr-mono rr-weak rr-block\">{p.namespace}</span></span>\n                                    <span class=\"rr-pkg-versions\"><template for:each={p.versions} for:item=\"v\"><span key={v.key} class=\"rr-small\">{v.version}</span></template></span>\n                                    <span><span class={p.statusCls}>{p.statusLabel}</span></span>\n                                    <span class=\"rr-pkg-actions\">\n                                        <template lwc:if={p.upgrade}><lightning-button label=\"Add upgrade step\" data-key={p.key} onclick={addUpgradeStep}></lightning-button></template>\n                                        <template lwc:if={p.canUninstall}><lightning-button label=\"Uninstall…\" data-key={p.namespace} onclick={openUninstall}></lightning-button></template>\n                                    </span>\n                                </div>\n                            </template>\n                        </div>\n                        <template lwc:if={showUninstall}>\n                            <div class=\"rr-uninstall\">\n                                <div class=\"rr-open-head\"><strong>{uninstallTitle}</strong><span class=\"rr-grow\"></span><button type=\"button\" class=\"rr-link\" onclick={closeUninstall}>Close</button></div>\n                                <p class=\"rr-small rr-weak\">Release Relay can't uninstall a package (Salesforce allows that only in Setup → Installed Packages). This starts a release with a ready-made manual step; Salesforce refuses the uninstall while your own metadata in {usageOrg} still uses the package, so those deletions go first.</p>\n                                <template lwc:if={usageLoading}><p class=\"rr-small rr-weak\">Reading what uses the package…</p></template>\n                                <template lwc:if={usageNote}><p class=\"rr-small rr-weak\">{usageNote}</p></template>\n                                <template lwc:if={usageNone}><p class=\"rr-small\">Nothing in {usageOrg} uses it, as far as Salesforce reports.</p></template>\n                                <template for:each={usageRows} for:item=\"u\">\n                                    <div key={u.key} class=\"rr-use\">\n                                        <button type=\"button\" class={u.pickCls} data-key={u.key} aria-pressed={u.pressed} onclick={toggleUsage}>{u.pickLabel}</button>\n                                        <span><span class=\"rr-strong\">{u.name}</span> <span class=\"rr-small rr-weak\">{u.type} · uses {u.uses}</span></span>\n                                        <span class=\"rr-pill rr-pill-bad\">Delete first</span>\n                                    </div>\n                                </template>\n                                <div class=\"rr-foot\">\n                                    <span class=\"rr-small\">{uninstallSummary}</span>\n                                    <span class=\"rr-grow\"></span>\n                                    <lightning-button variant=\"brand\" label=\"Start the release\" onclick={startUninstallRelease} disabled={usageLoading}></lightning-button>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </template>\n                    </section>\n                </template>\n            </div>\n        </template>\n    </template>\n</template>"}
